sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Ext as model-extractor<br/>Go CLI
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant Img as Container Image<br/>ubi9-minimal-pqc
    participant Dash as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant MC as odh-model-controller

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        note over CI,FS: Phase 1: Build-Time Catalog Generation
        CI->>Ext: Execute pipeline
        Ext->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HF-->>Ext: Model collections + metadata
        Ext->>Reg: GET /v2/.../manifests<br/>Auth: Docker credentials
        Reg-->>Ext: OCI manifests + layer data
        Ext->>GH: GET /repos/.../README.md<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
        GH-->>Ext: Agent metadata + READMEs
        note over Ext: Enrichment: merge HF frontmatter,<br/>modelcard.md, API data, registry metadata
        Ext->>FS: Write validated-models-catalog.yaml
        Ext->>FS: Write mcp-servers-catalog.yaml
        Ext->>FS: Write agents-catalog.yaml
        Ext->>FS: Write serving-runtimes-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        note over FS,Img: Phase 2: Container Image Build
        FS->>Img: COPY data/ /app/data/<br/>COPY benchmarks/ /app/benchmarks/
        note over Img: CMD sleep infinity<br/>Non-root UID 1001
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        note over Img,MC: Phase 3: Runtime Data Consumption
        Dash->>Img: Volume mount /app/data/
        Img-->>Dash: Model catalogs, MCP servers,<br/>agent starter kits
        MC->>Img: Volume mount /app/data/
        Img-->>MC: Serving runtime templates<br/>ServingRuntime v1alpha1
    end
